<title>USA: Roberts to license Lilly compound.</title>
<headline>Roberts to license Lilly compound.</headline>
<dateline>EATONTOWN, N.J. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roberts Pharmaceutical Corp said on Thursday it had agreed in principle to license from Eli Lilly and Co a compound for treating functional bowel disorders.</p>
<p>The compound, in development and designated as LY315535, is being licensed to Roberts for the U.S., Canada, and Mexico, the company said.</p>
<p>The agreement is an expansion of previously announced licensing arrangements between the two companies.</p>
